WEBVTT

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.490
Sorry, there.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.330
But it's all your fault.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.830
For telling me to move out of your way.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.080
Dr. Banhart!

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.300
Who are you?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:32.550
Hurry up or the others will drink up
all the blood!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.850
The party is over.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.940
And you weren't invited.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.730
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.690
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.910
And the gears turn

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.170
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.050
The story waits for no-one

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:12.920
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:16.180
A red past chases after you

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.510
The jester's smile

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.390
What's behind the mask?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.230
You can't erase the scars

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.110
No matter how they burn

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.940
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:32.990
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:38.780
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.870
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.420
That's the cue to begin

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.040
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:53.090
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.130
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.810
Until the day the curtain falls

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:06.140
The gears will keep turning

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.160
#24 Escape

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:22.120
Just two plain humans against us?
Don't make me laugh.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:26.250
I, Drill September, will kill you
in the blink of an eye.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:29.250
And take this loathsome Harry away.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.630
You'll see if I'm a plain human or not.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.180
-Stop!
-Huh, why?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.600
He said "us."

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:48.100
That means he's not the only one here.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.770
So my surprise attack is ruined.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.820
You have a cool head, young lady.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.200
I knew it. Come down, you coward!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:03.530
Of course, if there's somebody
who will fight me.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.700
I'll beat you both by myself.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:09.580
No, look at the doctors.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:18.760
To treat them as soon as possible
we need to beat both automata at once.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.140
I'll take the one on the swing.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.850
Are you sure, Miss Mingxia?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:30.140
I lived through the Sahara war
with you, remember?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.350
Yeah.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.480
But there is one thing you could do.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:36.320
Yes.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.650
Promise me something.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:45.030
That if I win, you'll drop the "Miss"
and just call me Mingxia.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.540
Sure. Be careful.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.290
All right!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.790
What was that?

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.130
How long are you going to
keep me waiting, human?

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.880
Better hurry up
or your little friends are going to die.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.220
Thanks, Miss Mingxia.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.640
You've cleared my mind.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.400
We just can't lose this fight!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.780
That's the spirit!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.530
-He's good.
-Come on.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.370
Here's a present.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.500
Too slow!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.750
Too quick for you!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.500
You're mine.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.630
Impossible... He countered it?

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.020
What's wrong?

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.070
Miss Mingxia!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.570
Her fist loaded with "Qi"
doesn't affect him?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.070
Hello, young lady. And now, goodbye.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.750
My name is Blom Blom Low.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.540
I'm the leader of the assault team.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.600
Miss Mingxia!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.970
No, wake up!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.940
It's just like that human, Jaspers, wrote.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:43.440
Humans can't
grasp their limits objectively.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.240
That's why they lose.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.990
You bastard...

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:53.000
How could you... You'll die for this!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.420
It's quiet.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.260
How long is this going to last?
There's no end to it.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:12.010
I'm fighting for the children,
for the people with ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:17.730
I never used to fight for anybody
other than myself.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.820
When did I change?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:26.360
It's become natural for me
to fight to protect somebody else.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.540
Must be because Narumi kept shouting it.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:40.330
That's right, he'll shout at me again
if I keep complaining like this.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.760
I'm going to save Miss Mingxia
and everyone else.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.760
I'll finish it in one blow!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.730
Crushing fist!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.810
It's not working?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:07.110
You fool. Did you not see
the girl trying the same thing?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.240
Can't do a single thing? Poor you!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:21.420
Oh, you think you've stopped me
from swinging like that?

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.760
But look at how many swings I have.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.800
Damn it!

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.810
Nope, over here.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.020
It's the limit situation
as stated by Jaspers.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:49.990
The inevitable situation born amidst
blood and distress.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:54.990
As those in the limit situation
work together,

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.370
they are able to discover
the true way of living.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.460
But dear me.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:04.880
It won't apply for this situation.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:10.420
Because those who you should work with
are lying on the floor!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.260
Splitting fist!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.520
I told you, that doesn't work.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.100
Now, time to end this.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.610
Pray to your god now.

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:34.870
Oh yeah.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:40.700
Old habits are hard to break.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:48.300
I forgot my body wasn't
a regular body anymore.

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:53.510
My body can do more now.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.890
It's wanting to do more.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.270
What are you talking about?

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.520
Hey, Blom.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.190
What you said.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:10.070
About how humans working together
can overcome limit situations.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.780
Well, if that's the case.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:18.030
I've surpassed the limit long ago.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.540
I have no god to pray to.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.710
But I have an altar I can place you on.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.040
Interesting.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.960
Then write on that altar with your blood.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:35.090
That as a human, you couldn't overcome
the limit situation!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.560
Wheels?

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.940
But there's the wall.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:48.400
Huh?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.400
Fool, flying towards your death.

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.940
No punch could...

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.630
What the...

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:17.680
Don't get cocky. I won't be surprised
by some punching machine anymore.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:23.390
I'll say it again.
You can't overcome this limit situation.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.940
Because you're human!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.060
I will.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.870
Over and over, I will.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.290
Impossible...!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:53.210
Until the last automaton
is wiped from this earth!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:02.930
How...?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.810
A human like you,
overcoming the limit situation?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.980
This arm that beat you down.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:15.150
It was given to me by a man
who once fought by me named Timbavati.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.700
The foot that charged at you is from Tor.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:23.910
The foot that crushed you
is from Mr. Rockenfield.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.160
You thought you were fighting
a man who was on his own.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.710
But never was I alone.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:40.680
By working together with others...

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.470
You found the truth
inside the limit situation...

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:49.640
You win, human...

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.730
Miss Mingxia... Miss Mingxia!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.740
Good, she's still breathing.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.950
And that sound.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.790
The Aqua Vitae inside her
is still working.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:24.720
Die, Ashihana!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.530
Mr. Pantalone.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:45.660
Did you miss on purpose...?

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.950
It seemed that way.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:52.410
So what if I did?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:59.170
Nothing. It's none of my business.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.220
I just never thought...

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:08.310
there'd ever be an automaton
who had mercy.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.560
Mercy?

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.520
What's that?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:21.990
To be kind for the sake of others.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:29.080
Then Lady Francine must be the one
who had mercy.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.790
She told me before I came here.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.420
To never hurt another human again.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.840
But I still hurt you.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:48.140
I couldn't follow her orders.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.970
How ironic...

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:57.600
I'd just finally been reunited
with my rightful master.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.360
But now, I have no place to return to.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.570
Ashihana.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.160
End me, now.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.790
In that case...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:19.210
how about following her orders
from now on?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.960
Begin anew.

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:46.150
Humph, this old piece of junk
can't move anymore.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.490
Les Quatre Pionniers or whatever.
What a joke.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:54.290
Come on, let's go finish those humans off.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:05.800
That's how all automata are.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.770
My hand can move.

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:18.270
The numbness is wearing off.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:29.400
I see. There was only a little bit
of shirogane blood in Ashihana.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.280
But even if I can move now...

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.330
where am I to go?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.080
In that case...

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:45.670
how about following her orders
from now on?

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.260
Begin anew.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.100
He's a monster!

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.060
He's still standing after all this.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:05.270
Guy, can you hear me?
This is Narumi, we got Harry.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:09.440
Humph. It took you long enough.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:14.740
The dress of my beautiful Olympia
is all in tatters now.

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.500
But there are just too many.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.250
Damn it!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.460
George, Ashihana! It's your job
to get Harry out of here.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.300
Hurry up and bring the transport.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:36.310
Sure thing. I know what to do.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.310
I'll call it over.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.860
This is the station! And the station
master is blowing his whistle!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:49.320
We're ready to get on board! Come out!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.780
Fou prepared it for us.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:03.330
Narumi, once you get Harry on it,
get out of here. I'll stop the automata.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.590
Are you okay? I'm going over to help.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:11.920
No! I'll get out of here
once I beat all the automata.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.090
It may take some time though.

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:17.600
But don't worry. Hurry up and go!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.720
Guy!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.850
What is this?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.100
It's finally here.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.020
Stopping, stopping.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.900
Thank you for boarding.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:37.370
Let me know when you've chosen
our next destination.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.870
Hey, you're alive.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.370
Get Harry and the kids!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.500
Sure thing, I'm on it.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.550
I mustn't drop...

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.140
I won't drop.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.720
I promised Narumi.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:05.520
That I'd hold my ground here.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:11.270
I won't let myself drop.
It goes against my pride.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.610
Never...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.490
You're going down now! We'll cut you up!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.090
What, you can move now?

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.260
Are you going to kill that human?

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.340
Obviously, duh.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.400
Guy!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.780
Pantalone!

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.160
Humph, here to help?

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.950
Then hurry up and take that man.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.580
I thought I beat you in the Sahara.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.670
Lord Faceless fixed me.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.960
Why did you save Guy?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.880
Because Lady Francine gave me an order.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.430
Not to hurt any humans.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:26.520
Lord Faceless calls her Éléonore, though.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:31.150
What? Éléonore is with you?

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.820
Mr. Guy is safe now, let's go!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.570
Okay.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.070
Long-legged Clown Express, depart!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.450
Okay, all aboard!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.380
Where is she now?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:57.380
Don't get me wrong.
I'm not going to tell you everything.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:02.800
I'd never tell you anything
disadvantageous to Lord Faceless.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.640
Now go.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.060
And you?

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.560
None of your business.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.280
Die, you fool!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.170
Don't get me wrong.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.800
You're coming with me
to answer my questions!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.180
Let go of me!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.430
Get on first!

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:42.490
Not all hope for humankind is lost now.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:48.160
Now, how about the little knight
who's gone to save the princess?

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.490
Let's take a look.

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:56.120
Master, I see it!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:03.630
Faceless,
I won't let you have it your way.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.140
I'm coming, Shirogane!

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:32.040
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:36.960
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:41.670
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:46.470
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:51.470
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:56.180
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.350 --> 00:22:59.230
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:05.360
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.780
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:15.500
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:23.750
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:31.760
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:39.140
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
